# asdf / mise toolchain pin. Ensures local dev, CI, and any AI-agent sandbox
# resolve the same versions of every tool the project builds with.
#
# Install either asdf (https://asdf-vm.com/) or mise (https://mise.jdx.dev/)
# and these versions will be picked up automatically when you cd into the
# repo root. `mise install` / `asdf install` fetches everything.
#
# Bumping a version here is the single source of truth; update the CI
# workflow at the same time (workflows use `go-version-file: go.mod` where
# possible, which already tracks this file's Go pin via go.mod).
golang 1.26.5
# 22.23.2 is the current 22.x LTS and clears the 22.22.0 floor that react-router
# 8.3.0 declares in engines.node. The pin sat at 22.21.0, below that floor, so a
# fresh mise/asdf install warned EBADENGINE while CI, which installs a floating
# `node-version: 22`, silently ran a newer runtime. CI stays floating on purpose
# (every workflow pins only the major), so this value is NOT kept byte-equal to
# whatever CI resolves; it only has to sit at or above the highest engines.node
# floor in the dependency tree. Raise it when a dependency raises that floor.
nodejs 22.23.2
golangci-lint 2.11.3
lefthook 1.8.0
task 3.50.0
